Codex standalone adaptation
--------------------------
This distribution is HALOFLUX Codex, a modified, unofficial standalone local
dashboard. It uses the community Canvas engine adapted above and adds a
read-only Codex rollout-log parser, semantic panels, action/target recognition,
bounded result summaries, current-turn failure notices, a local HTTP host,
portable startup entry points and synthetic-data tests.

It does not include or install the DeepSeek Harness plugin host, the DSH
settings/HUD integration, or the original music file. It does not replace the
Codex application's background. The preserved upstream NOTICE above describes
the upstream project; it is not a list of features shipped by this adaptation.

